{"checkedAt":"2026-09-26T18:05:20.499Z","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3050","imdbCode":"tt0118437","seriesTitle":"The Practice","imdbRating":7.7,"imdbVotes":11862,"episodes":[{"season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Pilot","summary":"Bobby defends a young girl charged with possession of drugs with intent to distribute, and Lindsay is shocked to find herself facing a former law professor in a case against a big tobacco company.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/382/957386.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Part II","summary":"Eugene tries to protect a client whose husband terrorizes her and their son. Meanwhile, Bobby seeks the help of an old friend who's a loan officer in an attempt to keep the firm afloat.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/fIVaTsi5XkoD7j6YoONW9FKs5bx.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Trial and Error","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Trial and Error","summary":"Bobby is hired in a civil case involving the murder of a young woman who was strangled by her boyfriend, and Jimmy is worried about losing his job when bank officials start questioning the loan he gave Bobby's firm.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/pSuy9qS3PggrSBURIKoKpEmD1VL.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Part IV","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Part IV","summary":"A nervous Lindsay prepares for her first appearance before a jury in a wrongful death case against a tobacco company. Elsewhere, Bobby is stunned by the unexpected results of the Ronald Martin murder trial, involving a grieving father, the man's rabbi and the defendant.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/qRvg842ldO2UvRdUpvQdjOxLIYG.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Part V","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Part V","summary":"Bobby faces a dilemma when a client accused of a crime of passion refuses to plead temporary insanity; Eugene defends a man convicted of armed robbery; and Ellenor grows apprehensive about her blind date.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/krdSRoMLlht0mpoZOMMN7VAxhjW.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Part VI","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Part VI","summary":"Gerald Braun goes on trial for murdering his daughter's killer, and Bobby argues the execution was moral. Meanwhile, Eugene defends a 19-year-old accused of statutory rape, and Lindsay represents a bomber who wants to surrender after being a fugitive for 26 years.","imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt0118437/1/6","imageSource":"fallback","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Reasonable Doubts","summary":"Bobby's judgment is called into question by the firm's other members when he becomes romantically involved with a beautiful, icy client who shot to death a male neighbor she claims was attempting to rape her. The prosecution says it was murder.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/465/1164856.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Betrayal","summary":"The firm defends Joey Heric, a colorful client on trial for the murder of his lover. Jimmy is tried on solicitation charges by a vengeful district attorney.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/466/1166881.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":3,"title":"The Blessing","summary":"Bobby and Gamble clash in and out of the courtroom when an emotional assisted-suicide case forces them to confront painful memories. Meanwhile, Lindsay goes head-to-head with her ex-boyfriend when she defends an elderly bookie.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/467/1168813.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Dog Bite","summary":"Jimmy finally gets his first case, that of a little girl bitten by a dog. A juror approaches Lindsay with inside information on a case. Eugene defends a one-legged mugger.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/468/1171255.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":5,"title":"First Degree","summary":"Ellenor and Lindsay face disbarment proceedings for their unethical conduct. Bobby defends a man accused of murdering his lover's husband. Eugene represents a police officer applying for disability, claiming the job made him a racist.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/8baDlKUDvHI7vZTB6bqAnZtF25c.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Sex, Lies and Monkeys (2)","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Sex, Lies and Monkeys","summary":"Ellenor is sued by George Vogelman, her podiatrist friend, for causing him emotional distress, while Jimmy defends a man who lost his job because in the eyes of his boss, he looks like a monkey. Lindsay has hazy recollections about a night out with Chris Kelton.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/zMu06ycmWxR9DC2HvEpBMJWE3DV.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Search and Seizure","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Search and Seizure","summary":"Rebecca's friend enlists the firm to try to set a legal precedent by forcing his wife to have a C-section against her wishes. Benny Small is tried for drug possession.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/50156I4QZPLl1cSOzxQlA1acFB7.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"The Means","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":8,"title":"The Means","summary":"A black client is tried for the brutal beating of a department store security guard during a riot. Bobby plans to use a defense very unpopular with both his client and second-chair Eugene. Meanwhile, Ellenor's obnoxious cousin wants to sue the travel agent that booked her honeymoon on allegations of 'emotional distress'.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/vmkhuUzaQoyPzVqocFxlvhmLAbh.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Save the Mule","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":9,"title":"Save the Mule","summary":"Lindsay is hired by a drug dealer to defend his \"\"mule\"\" who's been caught smuggling drugs over the border. Jimmy takes on a case of a community stricken by cancer. Bobby must decide with whom he wants to pursue a romance.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/472/1182040.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":10,"title":"Spirit of America","summary":"Donnell &amp; Associates travel to Redland Hills in a last minute attempt to get a stay of execution for convicted murderer Randall Jefferson while a documentary crew watches their every move.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/3jWj7VhigAoaKsNkD1876zs9GTR.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Hide and Seek","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":11,"title":"Hide and Seek","summary":"Bobby and Lindsay second-chair Bobby's old mentor, Raymond Oz, when Oz fears he's losing his memory. Eugene struggles with his conscience when he defends a man on trial for raping and murdering two boys. Jimmy's fantasies come true when a childhood sex symbol seeks his legal counsel.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/7uOiQbaZ0ukviZdiRQaEEQR7qKy.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Race with the Devil","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":12,"title":"Race with the Devil","summary":"When Bobby's priest performs an exorcism on a parishioner, who dies during the procedure, Bobby must manipulate the system to shield Father Martin from murder charges; Eugene represents Martin Parks in a bizarre malpractice suit. Jimmy decides to tape a television commercial, a decision that proves unpopular with his colleagues.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/475/1189245.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":13,"title":"The Civil Right","summary":"Jimmy is furious when his mother reveals her love for another woman. He feels obligated to represent her in court when she requests he argue her right to marry her lover. Meanwhile, Eugene refuses to defend a rapist after he runs into one of his client's victims in a clothing store.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/476/1191874.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":14,"title":"The Pursuit of Dignity","summary":"Bobby reconnects with an old girlfriend who needs his help after she is arrested for prostitution. Ellenor and Rebecca fight to keep a 12-year old girl with Tourette's Syndrome in school. Lindsay defends a woman who is suing her doctor for sewing live maggots into her leg to prevent post-surgical infection.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/1L3xAwUkLseVz3SiEvvuTJcTb6l.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Line of Duty","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":15,"title":"Line of Duty","summary":"Bobby is arrested and tried for the deaths of three police officers, after he tips off a client, using information obtained during a sleepover at Helen's, that the police are planning to raid him. Jimmy has to defend himself when an opposing attorney claims he's unfit to practice law.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/478/1196726.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":16,"title":"Truth and Consequences","summary":"Rebecca's life is threatened after she witnesses a murder and picks the killer out of a police lineup. Jimmy continues his case against the electric company.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/eXT7OJasiXbY9FyHLC1xMiz3CNd.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Burden of Proof","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":17,"title":"Burden of Proof","summary":"The trial against Boston Electric begins, with Jimmy bringing both a weak case and doubts as to whether his star witness will be sober, into court.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/wZTUeKVsotuFKAtOwSn3Eg2vzrd.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Ties That Bind","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":18,"title":"Ties That Bind","summary":"Lindsay and Ellenor defend a pornographic star accused of killing her co-star. Complications arise in the Moreno case when it appears Rebecca's ID of the suspect may have been tainted. Lindsay's fondness for having her elbows sucked works against Bobby when he sucks on Helen's elbows.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/hS0yd85jaFqxMybdjylxxOfXKyS.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"The Trial (1)","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":19,"title":"The Trial","summary":"Bobby defends Dr. Jeffrey Winslow, on trial for the brutal murder (and decapitation) of his mistress. Neither Bobby nor Helen (the D.A. on the case) will back down, sending their relationship into a tailspin. Eugene defends Rebecca's irascible uncle on tax evasion charges.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/oSwglvGtnLiwLylhskqRXtbPPNp.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Cloudy With a Chance of Membranes (2)","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":20,"title":"Cloudy with a Chance of Membranes","summary":"The saga of Dr. Jeffery Winslow continues. Bobby uses every trick in the book to keep Dr. Winslow out of jail.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/vRo4lMClyXIf9ePyUsvnW18Tcc9.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"In Deep","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":21,"title":"In Deep","summary":"The Luis Moreno case finally comes to trial with Rebecca more determined than ever to testify. Ellenor rushes off to defend Cruikshank again, leaving Lindsay to defend a man being cited for using too much water in his toilet. Eugene faces his own prejudices during an altercation with a dry cleaner.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/ju3Xz2yxtvM1cAk1EyIhApPUzey.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Another Day","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":22,"title":"Another Day","summary":"Bobby is called on to defend Joey Heric on murder charges once again. Lindsay goes up against her former professor, Anderson Pearson, when she represents a client who's addicted to cigarettes. Lindsay sues Pearson himself when she suspects his firm of burying damaging information. Ellenor defends Cruikshank against anti-tourism charges, earning her several trips to jail when she vehemently disagrees with the judge's decidedly biased position.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/4kZ3Z2QlPle6SXEtchdJaRl9AIq.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Checkmate","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":23,"title":"Checkmate","summary":"Joey's case comes to trial. Ellenor represents a woman heckled by a carnival clown.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/lED7cp1untdBBk7mYgGZYRmLNSo.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Trees in the Forest","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":24,"title":"Trees in the Forest","summary":"Tensions rise when Lindsay requests a partnership. Eugene defends a gang member on murder charges while Rebecca receives an animal rights activism award.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/qv8AjWNWcP4TJkoJw1mZlXNYEm4.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Food Chains","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":25,"title":"Food Chains","summary":"The furor over Lindsay's demand for partnership continues. Bobby discovers that Lindsay's not the only associate looking for another job. Rebecca is involved in a car accident she believes is a scam. Rebecca and Jimmy go undercover to ferret out the guilty. Ellenor meets up with an old friend in the midst of a chimpanzee custody trial.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/aNnPK2KASs69zkO7K3ZkVxKykL4.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Axe Murderer (II)","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":26,"title":"Axe Murderer","summary":"Bobby works with the firm of Cage and Fish to help in the defense of Marie Hanson, an apparent axe murderer who may have been Lizzie Borden in a past life. Ellenor discovers that her new boyfriend, Fred Spivak, is the crooked chiropractor treating Rebecca, while Lindsay and Helen discuss Helen's future with the DA's office.Part 2/2 - continuation on \"Ally McBeal\" (Season 1, Episode 20).","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/pUwViRxxfDg1Nmx5BjB3XwT7XQa.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Duty Bound","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":27,"title":"Duty Bound","summary":"Jimmy's faith in his priest is shaken when Father Ryan is arrested for the murder of a 16-year-old boy. Jimmy desperately tries to track down the real killer before Father Ryan's case goes to trial. Ellenor struggles over her sense of ethics and her blossoming relationship with Fred Spivak.","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/2dJdlNV4hOMYTragN3vr0tns7kd.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Rhyme and Reason","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":28,"title":"Rhyme and Reason","summary":"Bobby defends a young boy who killed his mother over a seemingly inconsequential argument. Eugene wrestles with his conscience over the morality of his profession and its possible effects on his son, Kendall. Lindsay tries to land a class action asbestos suit.","imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt0118437/2/28","imageSource":"fallback","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":1,"title":"Passing Go","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/whpjt4vk0R9UlZDDm801tZ2kyUf.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Passing Go","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":2,"title":"Reasons to Believe","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/jwS4tp24wM9fu2sB8eZKRJXW9Ik.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Body Count","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":3,"title":"Body Count","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/f2aU3SzZ2SzAFTC8ADLJPPooKEs.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"The Defenders","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":4,"title":"The Defenders","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/5u6exyLQRcURSsMUogAUyrjDL1L.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"The Battlefield","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":5,"title":"The Battlefield","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/504/1260457.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":6,"title":"One of Those Days","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/4cpKKATlOtDYa6cAL9wzqKr7XUz.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Trench Work","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":7,"title":"Trench Work","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/q6e6biZmXgg0ZqSrGg8E2tYvkkn.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Swearing In","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":8,"title":"Swearing In","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/qvU8rkSahP1DmId533Fpaij9HWa.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"State of Mind","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":9,"title":"State of Mind","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/fOhdlEJ9OK0qMM9OA3fUveXpAmF.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Love and Honor","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":10,"title":"Love and Honor","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/m9Fl44cBHnMMH2nMkj4bVUWvDMA.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Split Decisions","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":11,"title":"Split Decisions","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/wJJgAj3V1l6WM9Jbbb2nxw8cG3n.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"A Day in the Life","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":12,"title":"A Day in the Life","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/cyHvs9u9PmfSJlUifnUEzbfuSec.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Judge and Jury","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":13,"title":"Judge and Jury","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/sgmWhWK3MY6TxHyZm3LeXMMeFYP.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imageAlt":"Of Human Bondage","imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":3,"episode":14,"title":"Of Human Bondage","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w454_and_h254_face/2XuKDKs0jdJHfOX6fM6TQ3fuaNZ.jpg","imageSource":"tmdb","imag